---
---
<section id="portaal" class="w-full bg-white py-20 md:py-28 relative reveal">
  <!-- Decorative Background Grid -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(var(--color-brand-primary)_0.5px,transparent_0.5px)] [background-size:24px_24px] opacity-[0.03] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 relative">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-brand-primary font-display font-black text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
        <svg class="w-4.5 h-4.5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
          <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM9.555 7.168A1 1 0 008 8v4a1 1 0 001.555.832l3-2a1 1 0 000-1.664l-3-2z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
        </svg>
        Edusafe Online Academie
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-brand-secondary leading-tight mb-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        Maak kennis met ons nieuwe <span class="relative inline-block text-white px-5 py-2 mx-1 mt-2 transform -rotate-1"><span class="absolute inset-0 bg-brand-accent rounded-2xl z-0"></span><span class="relative z-10">e-learning portaal</span></span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-brand-dark/70 text-base md:text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto mt-4">
        Snel je theoriecertificaat halen als zelfstandige, of de veiligheid van al je medewerkers beheren vanaf één centraal dashboard.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Two Pillars: ZZP vs MKB (Side-by-side cards) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 max-w-[1040px] mx-auto items-stretch reveal-stagger">
      
      <!-- Pillar 1: ZZP & Particulieren -->
      <div class="rounded-[32px] bg-white border border-brand-dark/5 p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-[0_15px_40px_rgba(14,34,61,0.08)] hover:shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(14,34,61,0.15)] transition-all duration-500 hover:scale-[1.01] relative group h-full">
        <div>
          <!-- Header and Badges -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-brand-dark/10 text-brand-dark/60 uppercase tracking-wider bg-white">
              Individueel & Snel
            </span>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-primary">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z" />
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Cover Image -->
          <div class="relative w-full aspect-[16/9] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-cream-dark to-brand-cream border border-brand-dark/5 shadow-sm">
            <img 
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516321318423-f06f85e504b3?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=600" 
              alt="E-learning ZZP & Particulieren" 
              class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover block opacity-95 group-hover:scale-102 transition-transform duration-500" 
            />
          </div>

          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-black text-brand-secondary mb-4">
            Voor ZZP & Particulieren
          </h3>
          <p class="text-brand-dark/70 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">
            De snelste manier om volledig gecertificeerd te worden. Start direct online met je theorie en plan je praktijkdag wanneer het jou uitkomt.
          </p>

          <!-- Checkmarks List -->
          <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-brand-dark/80">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-mobile-screen-button text-[10px]"></i>
              </div>
              <span><strong>Studeer op je mobiel:</strong> Altijd en overal toegang tot de lesstof.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-brand-dark/80">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt text-[10px]"></i>
              </div>
              <span><strong>Start direct:</strong> Geen wachttijden, direct beginnen met leren.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-brand-dark/80">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-tag text-[10px]"></i>
              </div>
              <span><strong>Scherpe prijzen:</strong> De voordeligste manier om je certificaat te halen.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-brand-dark/80">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap text-[10px]"></i>
              </div>
              <span><strong>100% Slagingsgarantie</strong> op je theorie-examen.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Button -->
        <a href="/e-learning" class="font-display font-black text-sm py-4 px-6 rounded-2xl text-center bg-brand-primary text-white hover:bg-brand-primary-hover transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_4px_15px_rgba(27,102,177,0.2)]">
          Direct Online Starten
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 2: MKB & Bedrijven (Highlighted Dark Navy Card) -->
      <div class="rounded-[32px] bg-brand-secondary text-white p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(14,34,61,0.25)] hover:shadow-[0_25px_60px_rgba(14,34,61,0.35)] transition-all duration-500 hover:scale-[1.01] relative group h-full">
        <!-- Floating badge/doodle pointer -->
        <div class="absolute -top-3.5 right-8 bg-brand-accent text-white font-display font-black text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full shadow-lg border border-white/10 z-10">
          Meest Gekozen
        </div>

        <div>
          <!-- Header and Badges -->
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-8">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full border border-white/10 text-brand-accent uppercase tracking-wider bg-white/5">
              Beheer & Voordeel
            </span>
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-brand-accent/25 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-accent shadow-[0_3px_8px_rgba(255,107,53,0.2)]">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-building text-lg"></i>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Cover Image -->
          <div class="relative w-full aspect-[16/9] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-6 bg-brand-secondary-hover border border-white/10 shadow-sm">
            <img 
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522071820081-009f0129c71c?auto=format&fit=crop&q=80&w=600" 
              alt="MKB Werkgeversportaal" 
              class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover block opacity-70 mix-blend-luminosity group-hover:opacity-90 group-hover:scale-102 transition-all duration-500" 
            />
          </div>

          <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">
            Voor MKB & Bedrijven
          </h3>
          <p class="text-white/80 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">
            Het complete Werkgeversportaal. Beheer de compliance, uitnodigingen en herhalingstrainingen van al je personeel vanaf één overzichtelijk dashboard.
          </p>

          <!-- Checkmarks List -->
          <ul class="space-y-4 mb-8">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-white/90">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-accent/20 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-accent shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-column text-[10px]"></i>
              </div>
              <span><strong>Centraal Dashboard:</strong> Live voortgang van al je medewerkers inzien.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-white/90">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-accent/20 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-accent shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope text-[10px]"></i>
              </div>
              <span><strong>Automatisch Uitnodigen:</strong> Nodig medewerkers uit en het portaal doet de rest.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-white/90">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-accent/20 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-accent shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-folder-open text-[10px]"></i>
              </div>
              <span><strong>Digitaal Archief:</strong> Alle certificaten en pasjes direct downloadbaar.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm font-medium text-white/90">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-accent/20 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-accent shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-briefcase text-[10px]"></i>
              </div>
              <span><strong>Groepskortingen:</strong> Voordelige staffeltarieven voor teams vanaf 5 personen.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Button -->
        <a href="#contact" class="font-display font-black text-sm py-4 px-6 rounded-2xl text-center bg-brand-accent text-white hover:bg-brand-accent-hover transition-all duration-300 shadow-[0_4px_15px_rgba(255,107,53,0.3)]">
          Ontdek het Werkgeversportaal
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
